          {
            "title": "Plus operator",
            "id": 82583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>dataset_1</code> ve <code>dataset_2</code> içindeki veri kümeleri gibi iki veri kümesini birleştirmek için listelerin adlarını ve <code>+</code> operatörünü kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(dataset_1 + dataset_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>dataset_1</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>dataset_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki listeyi birleştirmek için <code>+</code> kullan. Önce soldaki, ardından sağdaki listenin değerleri gelir.</p><p>Kodun <code>[4, 5, 1, 2, 3]</code> yazdırması için veri kümelerini birleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"dataset_2\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dataset_1\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4, 5, 1, 2, 3]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>dataset_2</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>dataset_1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
