            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> kullanıldığında, ikinci liste birinci listenin sonuna eklenir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(dataset_1 + dataset_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>+</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
