          {
            "title": "Different types",
            "id": 82585,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayısal <code>seats</code> ve boolean <code>taken</code> gibi farklı türlerde değerler içeren listeleri birleştirmek için <code>+</code> işlecini de kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"seats = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"taken = [\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats + taken)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, True, True, False]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>seats</code>, ardından <code>taken</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Farklı değer türlerini içeren listeleri birleştirmek için <code>+</code> kullanabilirsin.</p><p>Kodun <code>[1, 2, 3, True, True, False]</code> yazdırması için önce sayısal <code>seats</code>, sonra boolean <code>taken</code> listesini birleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"seats = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"taken = [\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats + taken)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, True, True, False]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>seats</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>taken</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
