            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birleştirilmiş listeyi yeniden kullanmak için onu bir değişkende saklayabiliriz; burada bu değişken <code>combined</code> olarak adlandırılmıştır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"combined = dataset_1 + dataset_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(combined)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>combined</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>dataset_1 + dataset_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Önce <code>dataset_1</code> gelecek şekilde iki veri kümesini birleştirip sonucu <code>combined</code> değişkenine kaydet. Böylece kod <code>[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"combined = dataset_1 + dataset_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(combined)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>combined</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>dataset_1</code>, <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>dataset_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
