            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>first = [\"A\", \"B\"]</code> ve <code>second = [\"C\", \"D\"]</code> ise <code>first + second</code> ne oluşturur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"C\", \"D\", \"A\", \"B\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"A\", \"C\", \"B\", \"D\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
