            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>customers</code> ve <code>order_number</code> listelerini, müşterilerin adları önce gelecek şekilde birleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(customers + order_number)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"93\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>customers</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>order_number</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adlar önce gelecek şekilde <code>customers</code> ile <code>order_number</code> listelerini birleştir. Böylece <code>['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]</code> yazdırılsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(customers + order_number)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>customers</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>order_number</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
