            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Önce <code>team_1</code> gelecek şekilde <code>team_1</code> ve <code>team_2</code> listelerini birleştir. Böylece kod <code>['Ana', 78, 'Joe', 80, 'Kim', 57, 'Sam', 60]</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team_1 + team_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 78, 'Joe', 80, 'Kim', 57, 'Sam', 60]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>team_1</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>team_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
